{"4476270":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Crown & Coin: The Hundred Years","steam_appid":4476270,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is an Early Access version. Steam lists it as a full release because of a setting I missed, but the game is still in development. More content is on the way, including an expanded mercenary career and more character stories. The price is planned to increase at full release.<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don the Crown, or Corrupt the World with Coin—<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Crown &amp; Coin: The Hundred Years&quot; is a <strong>&quot;Medieval Historical Ensemble Sandbox RPG&quot;<\/strong> set during the Hundred Years' War (1337-1453), boasting an overwhelming degree of freedom.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players are not omniscient gods looking down upon history. You are but a &quot;single human being&quot; surviving in a medieval Europe stained with blood, mud, and ambition. Will you trace orthodox history and become a hero, or shatter historical facts to establish an unprecedented new nation? Your choices will drive the 100 years of war.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/b23cbafceabfa8fd6716ef10d0795df9.poster.avif?t=1793729474\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/b23cbafceabfa8fd6716ef10d0795df9.webm?t=1793729474\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/b23cbafceabfa8fd6716ef10d0795df9.mp4?t=1793729474\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/217f20d292a475b66a0bee4f0e43e2c2.poster.avif?t=1793729474\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/217f20d292a475b66a0bee4f0e43e2c2.webm?t=1793729474\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/217f20d292a475b66a0bee4f0e43e2c2.mp4?t=1793729474\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ 1,015 Historical Characters + Your Very Own &quot;Original Protagonist&quot;<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From great historical heroes like Edward the Black Prince, Joan of Arc, and Bertrand du Guesclin, to ruthless mercenary captains (routiers), inquisitors, the False Joan (Claude des Armoises), and even the famous diarist known as the &quot;Bourgeois of Paris,&quot; <strong>all 1,015 historical characters featured in the game are fully playable!<\/strong> They each possess detailed stats and affinities based on historical facts.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, the game allows you to play as an <strong>&quot;Original Protagonist&quot;<\/strong> to forge history from absolute obscurity. Starting as a serf, as you rise to merchant, knight, and eventually a king, <strong>your protagonist's graphics will lavishly change to match your social standing<\/strong>.<br>(If you feel like you might get lost due to the overwhelming freedom, don't worry! There is an in-game manual feature where Master Guesclin will personally guide you!)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/5170593707539f4a1b22b7c1578c3351.poster.avif?t=1793729474\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/5170593707539f4a1b22b7c1578c3351.webm?t=1793729474\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/5170593707539f4a1b22b7c1578c3351.mp4?t=1793729474\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Overwhelming Freedom in Professions and Lifestyles<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War is not the only way to live in the Middle Ages. Hone 15 different skills (ranging from swordsmanship and archery to arithmetic, medicine, and blacksmithing) and carve out your own path.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Knight \/ Lord]<\/strong> A classic playthrough where you swear fealty to a king, lead armies to capture castles, and gather renown.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Clergy]<\/strong> Take the cloth, join a monastic order, and rise through the ranks using faith as your weapon. Bribe cardinals to aim for the seat of &quot;Pope,&quot; or become a dark power in the Dominican Order, branding political enemies as heretics and sending them to the &quot;stake (guaranteed death)&quot; once a year.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Merchant]<\/strong> Become the &quot;Ultimate Merchant&quot; who trades local specialties and uses immense wealth to buy off entire armies. In taverns, you can even gamble massive amounts of coin playing historically accurate board games (such as Tables).<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Mercenary \/ Bandit]<\/strong> Plunder (chevauchée) to your heart's content in regions where public order has collapsed, becoming a king of the underworld who rules through fear.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Troubadour]<\/strong> Sing epic poems of heroes and ballads of romance, aiming to become a legendary bard!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Others]<\/strong> Become a good doctor and save people from the plague, or a wicked doctor who prescribes real mummy powder to legally assassinate rivals. Become the &quot;world's best blacksmith&quot; who forges ultimate weapons, a mad gambler, or a legendary great pirate traveling to foreign lands. The playstyles are endless.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/baa5a90b6c4f6743671f8706a3f8e9cd.poster.avif?t=1793729474\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/baa5a90b6c4f6743671f8706a3f8e9cd.webm?t=1793729474\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/baa5a90b6c4f6743671f8706a3f8e9cd.mp4?t=1793729474\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/6e2c5ceed734e3211581914fd6ae03f8.poster.avif?t=1793729474\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/6e2c5ceed734e3211581914fd6ae03f8.webm?t=1793729474\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/6e2c5ceed734e3211581914fd6ae03f8.mp4?t=1793729474\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ The Ultimate Usurpation: &quot;Coronation&quot; at the Holy City of Reims and Seizing the Throne<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a war of conquering territory. If you establish your own new nation, capture the holy site &quot;Reims Cathedral,&quot; and hold a coronation ceremony, you will be recognized as the legitimate, god-blessed &quot;King of France.&quot;<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At that very moment, <strong>the former French royal house (House of Valois) will lose the throne and be humiliatingly demoted to a mere &quot;Duchy of Valois.&quot;<\/strong> Usurp historical legitimacy with your own strength and become the founder of a new dynasty.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/8d698391ca014f143bf203a5b52ae4ea.avif?t=1793729474\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras_big\/8d698391ca014f143bf203a5b52ae4ea.webp?t=1793729474 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ The Gritty, Unforgiving Reality of the Middle Ages<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs live with their own ambitions, desires, and religious beliefs.<br>You can assassinate political rivals and make it look like an &quot;accidental death,&quot; or corner the flour market in an enemy's castle town to starve the entire city.<br>Furthermore, a harsh daily life awaits: you can ambush travelers wandering the world map under the cover of darkness, or on the flip side, be scammed by a peddler into buying an unappraised item that turns out to be a &quot;dull sword.&quot;<br>And on the battlefield, gritty, realistic human dramas unfold—such as forging deep bonds with knights who have survived the brink of death with you by <strong>&quot;taking a leak side-by-side in the trenches.&quot;<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Just Uncheck &quot;Default&quot; and Select an Image! Custom Face Graphics &amp; Clan Flags Supported<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Do you absolutely want to survive the Hundred Years' War with your own avatar?&quot;<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course you can! No tedious setups are required. Simply place your favorite PNG image in the designated folder to feature your very own original character as the protagonist in the game. You can even fly your self-made image as an &quot;Original National Flag (Clan Flag)&quot; in the game. Establish a nation and forge a new superpower to rival France and England!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/c73d30ccdfcf5e1a284fd2937cc181d0.avif?t=1793729474\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras_big\/c73d30ccdfcf5e1a284fd2937cc181d0.avif?t=1793729474 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/fd5904f95b943917ab0cd28eb1734369.avif?t=1793729474\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras_big\/fd5904f95b943917ab0cd28eb1734369.avif?t=1793729474 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ 5 Era Scenarios and 22 Destinies Guided by the Tarot<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be started from 5 distinct eras (+ Custom Mode).<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[1344]<\/strong> The Dawn of War and the Threat of the Black Death<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[1355]<\/strong> The Black Prince's Great Chevauchée. An Era Overrun by Bandits<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[1397]<\/strong> Usurpation and the Rosebud (Power Struggles and Conspiracies)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【1413]<\/strong> The Miracle of Agincourt (England's Zenith)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【1427]<\/strong> The Maid of Orléans (France's Brink of Ruin and the Appearance of the Holy Maiden)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/10e90095f64a847aae8b453bcc2a1bbd.avif?t=1793729474\" width=362 height=308 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/860367446f5ef9fba4b9b90636802509.avif?t=1793729474\" width=300 height=308 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >History will branch off into chaos depending on your actions.<br>From a peaceful resolution where you drink with both the Kings of England and France, making them sign a peace treaty with hungover hands, to a mad ending where you <strong>fleece Gilles de Rais of his money in a gambling match inside a burning mansion<\/strong>. <strong>22 collectible multi-endings<\/strong> likened to tarot cards await you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/4f5efff5128a45f002b2342470853fda.avif?t=1793729474\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras_big\/4f5efff5128a45f002b2342470853fda.avif?t=1793729474 width=1560 height=880 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield your sword, or weave conspiracies. Forge your very own Hundred Years' War.<\/strong><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is an Early Access version. Steam lists it as a full release because of a setting I missed, but the game is still in development. More content is on the way, including an expanded mercenary career and more character stories. The price is planned to increase at full release.<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don the Crown, or Corrupt the World with Coin—<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Crown &amp; Coin: The Hundred Years&quot; is a <strong>&quot;Medieval Historical Ensemble Sandbox RPG&quot;<\/strong> set during the Hundred Years' War (1337-1453), boasting an overwhelming degree of freedom.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players are not omniscient gods looking down upon history. You are but a &quot;single human being&quot; surviving in a medieval Europe stained with blood, mud, and ambition. Will you trace orthodox history and become a hero, or shatter historical facts to establish an unprecedented new nation? Your choices will drive the 100 years of war.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/b23cbafceabfa8fd6716ef10d0795df9.poster.avif?t=1793729474\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/b23cbafceabfa8fd6716ef10d0795df9.webm?t=1793729474\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/b23cbafceabfa8fd6716ef10d0795df9.mp4?t=1793729474\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/217f20d292a475b66a0bee4f0e43e2c2.poster.avif?t=1793729474\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/217f20d292a475b66a0bee4f0e43e2c2.webm?t=1793729474\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/217f20d292a475b66a0bee4f0e43e2c2.mp4?t=1793729474\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ 1,015 Historical Characters + Your Very Own &quot;Original Protagonist&quot;<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From great historical heroes like Edward the Black Prince, Joan of Arc, and Bertrand du Guesclin, to ruthless mercenary captains (routiers), inquisitors, the False Joan (Claude des Armoises), and even the famous diarist known as the &quot;Bourgeois of Paris,&quot; <strong>all 1,015 historical characters featured in the game are fully playable!<\/strong> They each possess detailed stats and affinities based on historical facts.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, the game allows you to play as an <strong>&quot;Original Protagonist&quot;<\/strong> to forge history from absolute obscurity. Starting as a serf, as you rise to merchant, knight, and eventually a king, <strong>your protagonist's graphics will lavishly change to match your social standing<\/strong>.<br>(If you feel like you might get lost due to the overwhelming freedom, don't worry! There is an in-game manual feature where Master Guesclin will personally guide you!)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/5170593707539f4a1b22b7c1578c3351.poster.avif?t=1793729474\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/5170593707539f4a1b22b7c1578c3351.webm?t=1793729474\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/5170593707539f4a1b22b7c1578c3351.mp4?t=1793729474\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Overwhelming Freedom in Professions and Lifestyles<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War is not the only way to live in the Middle Ages. Hone 15 different skills (ranging from swordsmanship and archery to arithmetic, medicine, and blacksmithing) and carve out your own path.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Knight \/ Lord]<\/strong> A classic playthrough where you swear fealty to a king, lead armies to capture castles, and gather renown.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Clergy]<\/strong> Take the cloth, join a monastic order, and rise through the ranks using faith as your weapon. Bribe cardinals to aim for the seat of &quot;Pope,&quot; or become a dark power in the Dominican Order, branding political enemies as heretics and sending them to the &quot;stake (guaranteed death)&quot; once a year.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Merchant]<\/strong> Become the &quot;Ultimate Merchant&quot; who trades local specialties and uses immense wealth to buy off entire armies. In taverns, you can even gamble massive amounts of coin playing historically accurate board games (such as Tables).<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Mercenary \/ Bandit]<\/strong> Plunder (chevauchée) to your heart's content in regions where public order has collapsed, becoming a king of the underworld who rules through fear.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Troubadour]<\/strong> Sing epic poems of heroes and ballads of romance, aiming to become a legendary bard!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Others]<\/strong> Become a good doctor and save people from the plague, or a wicked doctor who prescribes real mummy powder to legally assassinate rivals. Become the &quot;world's best blacksmith&quot; who forges ultimate weapons, a mad gambler, or a legendary great pirate traveling to foreign lands. The playstyles are endless.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/baa5a90b6c4f6743671f8706a3f8e9cd.poster.avif?t=1793729474\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/baa5a90b6c4f6743671f8706a3f8e9cd.webm?t=1793729474\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/baa5a90b6c4f6743671f8706a3f8e9cd.mp4?t=1793729474\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/6e2c5ceed734e3211581914fd6ae03f8.poster.avif?t=1793729474\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/6e2c5ceed734e3211581914fd6ae03f8.webm?t=1793729474\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/6e2c5ceed734e3211581914fd6ae03f8.mp4?t=1793729474\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ The Ultimate Usurpation: &quot;Coronation&quot; at the Holy City of Reims and Seizing the Throne<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a war of conquering territory. If you establish your own new nation, capture the holy site &quot;Reims Cathedral,&quot; and hold a coronation ceremony, you will be recognized as the legitimate, god-blessed &quot;King of France.&quot;<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At that very moment, <strong>the former French royal house (House of Valois) will lose the throne and be humiliatingly demoted to a mere &quot;Duchy of Valois.&quot;<\/strong> Usurp historical legitimacy with your own strength and become the founder of a new dynasty.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/8d698391ca014f143bf203a5b52ae4ea.avif?t=1793729474\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras_big\/8d698391ca014f143bf203a5b52ae4ea.webp?t=1793729474 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ The Gritty, Unforgiving Reality of the Middle Ages<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs live with their own ambitions, desires, and religious beliefs.<br>You can assassinate political rivals and make it look like an &quot;accidental death,&quot; or corner the flour market in an enemy's castle town to starve the entire city.<br>Furthermore, a harsh daily life awaits: you can ambush travelers wandering the world map under the cover of darkness, or on the flip side, be scammed by a peddler into buying an unappraised item that turns out to be a &quot;dull sword.&quot;<br>And on the battlefield, gritty, realistic human dramas unfold—such as forging deep bonds with knights who have survived the brink of death with you by <strong>&quot;taking a leak side-by-side in the trenches.&quot;<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Just Uncheck &quot;Default&quot; and Select an Image! Custom Face Graphics &amp; Clan Flags Supported<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Do you absolutely want to survive the Hundred Years' War with your own avatar?&quot;<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course you can! No tedious setups are required. Simply place your favorite PNG image in the designated folder to feature your very own original character as the protagonist in the game. You can even fly your self-made image as an &quot;Original National Flag (Clan Flag)&quot; in the game. Establish a nation and forge a new superpower to rival France and England!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/c73d30ccdfcf5e1a284fd2937cc181d0.avif?t=1793729474\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras_big\/c73d30ccdfcf5e1a284fd2937cc181d0.avif?t=1793729474 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/fd5904f95b943917ab0cd28eb1734369.avif?t=1793729474\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras_big\/fd5904f95b943917ab0cd28eb1734369.avif?t=1793729474 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ 5 Era Scenarios and 22 Destinies Guided by the Tarot<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be started from 5 distinct eras (+ Custom Mode).<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[1344]<\/strong> The Dawn of War and the Threat of the Black Death<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[1355]<\/strong> The Black Prince's Great Chevauchée. An Era Overrun by Bandits<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[1397]<\/strong> Usurpation and the Rosebud (Power Struggles and Conspiracies)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【1413]<\/strong> The Miracle of Agincourt (England's Zenith)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【1427]<\/strong> The Maid of Orléans (France's Brink of Ruin and the Appearance of the Holy Maiden)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/10e90095f64a847aae8b453bcc2a1bbd.avif?t=1793729474\" width=362 height=308 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/860367446f5ef9fba4b9b90636802509.avif?t=1793729474\" width=300 height=308 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >History will branch off into chaos depending on your actions.<br>From a peaceful resolution where you drink with both the Kings of England and France, making them sign a peace treaty with hungover hands, to a mad ending where you <strong>fleece Gilles de Rais of his money in a gambling match inside a burning mansion<\/strong>. <strong>22 collectible multi-endings<\/strong> likened to tarot cards await you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras\/4f5efff5128a45f002b2342470853fda.avif?t=1793729474\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/extras_big\/4f5efff5128a45f002b2342470853fda.avif?t=1793729474 width=1560 height=880 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield your sword, or weave conspiracies. Forge your very own Hundred Years' War.<\/strong><\/p>","short_description":"Survive the Hundred Years' War in this medieval ensemble sandbox. Play as 1,015 historical figures, from Joan of Arc to the imposter des Armoises. Gain glory as a knight, forge a new kingdom to crush England and France, or thrive as a bandit. Discover 22 tarot-based multiple endings!","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Indonesian, Ukrainian, Spanish - Latin America, Thai, Turkish, Vietnamese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Hindi","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/badbab5667917f5aeb41c40ae97dfc9ae9681c7b\/header.jpg?t=1793729474","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/7987184e2c6b27cc8deb43f28a449ff6b9abb044\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793729474","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/7987184e2c6b27cc8deb43f28a449ff6b9abb044\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793729474","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Any CPU from the last 10 years<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Potato Graphics<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 3 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Yes<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Runs on a potato.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 2.0 GHz Dual Core processor or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Integrated Graphics (Intel HD 4000 or better)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 3 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Onboard sound<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 10.15 Catalina or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Any Mac from the last decade<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> If it has a screen, it works<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Standard Mac audio<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Apple Silicon (M1\/M2\/M3) and Intel Macs are both supported.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 11 Big Sur or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3 or Apple M1<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or Apple Silicon<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Standard Mac audio<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS or SteamOS<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> A processor that knows how to compute<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Any GPU that supports OpenGL<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Any ALSA compatible sound card<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Works great on Steam Deck!<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Ubuntu 22.04 LTS or SteamOS 3.0<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 2.0 GHz Dual Core processor<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> OpenGL 3.0+ compatible GPU<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Any ALSA compatible sound card<\/li><\/ul>"},"developers":["MUZINA GAMES"],"publishers":["MUZINA GAMES"],"demos":[{"appid":4619520,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":2449,"final":1959,"discount_percent":20,"initial_formatted":"24,49€","final_formatted":"19,59€"},"packages":[1562272],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Crown & Coin: The Hundred Years","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1562272,"percent_savings_text":"-20% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Crown & Coin: The Hundred Years - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">24,49€<\/span> 19,59€","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":1959}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":true,"linux":true},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":64,"description":"Adjustable Text Size"},{"id":66,"description":"Color Alternatives"},{"id":82,"description":"#category_contrast_controls"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":78,"description":"Adjustable Difficulty"},{"id":76,"description":"Mouse Only Option"},{"id":80,"description":"#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":79,"description":"Save Anytime"},{"id":65,"description":"Subtitle Options"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"3","description":"RPG"},{"id":"28","description":"Simulation"},{"id":"2","description":"Strategy"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/f60fa8e9fb5a886231ff98822495b80d4530cd00\/ss_f60fa8e9fb5a886231ff98822495b80d4530cd00.600x338.jpg?t=1793729474","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/f60fa8e9fb5a886231ff98822495b80d4530cd00\/ss_f60fa8e9fb5a886231ff98822495b80d4530cd00.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793729474"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/4e6156addb8aa9cbbb1c9dd1ad563955cd1bd4ef\/ss_4e6156addb8aa9cbbb1c9dd1ad563955cd1bd4ef.600x338.jpg?t=1793729474","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/4e6156addb8aa9cbbb1c9dd1ad563955cd1bd4ef\/ss_4e6156addb8aa9cbbb1c9dd1ad563955cd1bd4ef.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793729474"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/9be85db990d66f134bad798af717f4f9f506c1f0\/ss_9be85db990d66f134bad798af717f4f9f506c1f0.600x338.jpg?t=1793729474","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/9be85db990d66f134bad798af717f4f9f506c1f0\/ss_9be85db990d66f134bad798af717f4f9f506c1f0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793729474"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/8ca97b8052d1e5a67f8dbdede70a045ebfef3798\/ss_8ca97b8052d1e5a67f8dbdede70a045ebfef3798.600x338.jpg?t=1793729474","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/8ca97b8052d1e5a67f8dbdede70a045ebfef3798\/ss_8ca97b8052d1e5a67f8dbdede70a045ebfef3798.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793729474"},{"id":4,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/77cb9719f4ca67c2dccb3fffa125fe88e02ed20c\/ss_77cb9719f4ca67c2dccb3fffa125fe88e02ed20c.600x338.jpg?t=1793729474","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/77cb9719f4ca67c2dccb3fffa125fe88e02ed20c\/ss_77cb9719f4ca67c2dccb3fffa125fe88e02ed20c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793729474"},{"id":5,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/c2342c558b98f861d525686fd3ca32a61531efc3\/ss_c2342c558b98f861d525686fd3ca32a61531efc3.600x338.jpg?t=1793729474","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/c2342c558b98f861d525686fd3ca32a61531efc3\/ss_c2342c558b98f861d525686fd3ca32a61531efc3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793729474"},{"id":6,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/93d3f086821563fa86d65e78c518709e91bcdeb2\/ss_93d3f086821563fa86d65e78c518709e91bcdeb2.600x338.jpg?t=1793729474","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/93d3f086821563fa86d65e78c518709e91bcdeb2\/ss_93d3f086821563fa86d65e78c518709e91bcdeb2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793729474"},{"id":7,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4476270\/d9229799f19295e5e8e19934a356a9f884d9c288\/ss_d9229799f19295e5e8e19934a356a9f88